/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 148 0 R
/E (Shopee.com is a widely used online shopping platform that lets users browse products, compare offers, read ratings and reviews, place items in a cart, choose payment and delivery options, and track orders through a web interface. Its public features include home-page merchandising, product search, filters, product detail pages, vouchers, checkout, and order-status views. Because the internal code and infrastructure are not visible to the tester, Shopee.com is an appropriate subject for black box testing. The platform can still be examined through user-facing inputs, outputs, response times, and behavior under normal and stressful conditions..)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
